component.text:
# MaintenanceDisclosure

ID: maintenance-disclosure

Reveals maintenance escalation instructions.

## Stories

### With Escalation

Story ID: maintenance-disclosure--with-escalation

Example for a building issue that needs immediate attention.

```
import { MaintenanceDisclosure } from 'design-mcp-storybook-fixture';

const WithEscalation = () => <MaintenanceDisclosure label="When should I call maintenance?">Call dispatch if there is standing water.</MaintenanceDisclosure>;
```

## Props

```
export type Props = {
  /**
    Question shown in the disclosure control.
  */
  label: string;
  /**
    Optional details shown after the disclosure opens.
  */
  children: ReactNode;
}
```

